# One line-ending policy for every clone, independent of core.autocrlf: text files are LF in
# the repository and in the working tree. CI (linux) and prettier both expect LF; without this,
# per-machine autocrlf settings smudge checkouts to CRLF and the local format gate fails on
# files nobody touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary content never gets ending conversion; explicit, not left to detection.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.zip binary
*.ico binary
